{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"32563","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v33335","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"神凪ると","creatorId":"vndb:s37518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s37518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s37518","name":"神凪ると","roleCode":"art","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:180870","source":"vndb"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"深海千住","creatorId":"vndb:s37517","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s37517","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s37517","name":"深海千住","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:180869","source":"vndb"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"森田 交一","creatorId":"vndb:s10366","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10366","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10366","name":"森田 交一","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:180867","source":"vndb"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"森田 交一","creatorId":"vndb:s10366","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10366","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10366","name":"森田 交一","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:180868","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"KEI","creatorId":"vndb:s41806","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s41806","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s41806","name":"KEI","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:180871","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Mary","creatorId":"vndb:s45705","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s45705","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s45705","name":"Mary","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:180872","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c107137","characterName":"九重花純","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c107137"},"originalCharacterName":"九重花純","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I'm no longer part of the Kokonoe family. We were a branch of the family in the first place so now that my parents aren't here anymore, I was basically abandonned by my relatives.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"—A former lady of a noble house living a tumultuous life full of drama."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was a daughter of a noble family, but her parents passed away after their family's financial affairs went bankrupt, leaving her behind to pay their debts. In order to pay those off, she is now working as a waitress at a café she was introduced to called \"Matsuyotei\". Her professional name is Sakura. She was betrothed to her childhood friend Utashiro Tobari, but the engagement has been terminated due to her circumstances."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c107137"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f4d4d1f8d9722b881895d1e3fe7074d4cc4f8f369fa6ff7c31418d659bb13026.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/202a120f6ade63ac7265bc78a2e44725c19ac633a5c765deea7fe3b4bcb84b03.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c107138","characterName":"雅楽代帳","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c107138"},"originalCharacterName":"雅楽代帳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1027"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Don't say 'former'! I'm always telling you to introduce me properly as your fiancé!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"— The rambunctious and resilient childhood friend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Childhood friend of the protagonist and her \"former\" fiancé. A third year high school student. He's the son and heir of the wealthy Utashiro family. He has a cheerful and energetic personality with a strong leadership, which makes him popular among his classmates. However, he is a little blindly devoted and becomes reckless when it comes to the one he still considers his 'betrothed', the main character."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Mystery kinemas, Strawberry ice cream"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Black coffee"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c107138"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25623a610286954c8b9ad95379087700e5c97559d52fdcb8a5a25154cdeef8cc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/0026ab2f33ac4c22d8b316961a2c84c99f26887ed9781903afab475f88685de6.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c107139","characterName":"平井鏡太郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c107139"},"originalCharacterName":"平井鏡太郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1116"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Yes. Don't hesitate to ask me anything on that matter.....via Utashiro.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"— A student who carefully peruses, reads and rereads his books."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a third-year senior at Daiichi High School, the same school as Tobari. He is a serious and hardworking person, but he hates to lose and is not good at getting involved with others. He is introduced as a \"friend\" by Tobari, but Kyoutarou himself seems to have mixed feelings about it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Literature, Black coffee"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Tilling rice fields, Easy-going people"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c107139"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d478084bbf8336c22f90cd4ae44393b1287cfe35abaef235f7fb414b1bac3a4d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/50067607c83e3f1a3077da7b69d8b019a64f1b953973fce2cf1241d366db7214.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c107141","characterName":"橘八尋","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c107141"},"originalCharacterName":"橘八尋","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"23"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"619"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"66"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I may be a simple costumer, but I am also a regular here, I can find the person you think of, you know?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"— A regular with a keen eye for detail."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A regular at the cafe where the protagonist works. He is a popular customer among the waitresses because of his slender figure, good looks, and soft manner. He always brings a walking stick. He is somewhat mysterious and elusive."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Friendly chats, Wine"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Vexation"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c107141"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/89bc2d793c92efc0d516abd9c85c2625ac25eed0d976752962068b88c2f96a34.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/16d7e1bb9af16c1ddc9d9f022ba169b523ae2d6bfa55fca89f9840a98ac62957.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c107145","characterName":"京子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c107145"},"originalCharacterName":"京子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"25"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"168"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"A waitress' job isn't to be captivated by men but to captivate them. Understood?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"— A talented and competitive senior female waitress."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A senpai of the protagonist at the café. She is a popular waitress but there's a strict and inaccessible athmosphere around her. It seems that even her colleagues who work with her for years have never seen her in private."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Honest people"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: People who are not serious"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c107145"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/9504c398d0a6aedc54c92545df61b0abd2f8f4fdc1e7a32d8ef5b3faaae95e3f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a74a45d3ff60de464db313bff116eb5b6ca41962c72b58a52844506f62b867d7.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p13037","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:7373","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p13037","name":"神海処","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:32563:7373","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p13037","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p13037","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p13037","name":"神海処","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:109229:v33335","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p13037","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p13037","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p13037","name":"神海処","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:109234:v33335","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p13037","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p13037","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p13037","name":"神海処","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:134821:v33335","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p13037","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p13037","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p13037","name":"神海処","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relat